 "caption": "10 LOSSES. 3 PROBLEMS. 🦖\n\nWe're 6-10 after snapping a six-game skid in Detroit (Raptors 105, Pistons 102). The same things keep showing up in the losses:\n\n1️⃣ Late fades: we lost the fourth quarter in all 6 losses of the skid (Celtics 13-23, Knicks 21-28, Wizards 20-25)\n2️⃣ Hot threes against us: opponents made 139 of 330 (42%) in our 10 losses, and the Lakers and Magic hit 18 each\n3️⃣ One guy takes over: Luka 45, Jokic 32\n\nScottie missed 4 of the 10. He scored 41 in the Orlando one.\n\nThe good news: 4-4 on the road, and 3 of the 10 were decided by 5 or less (Celtics by 5, Knicks by 4 in OT, Wizards by 4).\n\nNo trade, no panic. Wake up in the fourth quarter.\n\nWhich of the three would you fix first?\n\n#NBA #ScottieBarnes #Raptors #WeTheNorth #BasketBall",
